{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/314979efeaca2a48e43f7e01f6492663.avif?t=1768076344\" width=1560 height=422 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>Planetary Delivery Boys</strong> is an elite squadron of 1-4 <span class=\"bb_strike\">sacrificial</span> employees working for the 'Intergalactic Delivery Service'. Handle the delivery of packages aboard the Company Train. Keep it running by managing power, using the CCTV System, Manual Doors and Lights only when necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/e7269bb149d850ff080b9391a7871df5.poster.avif?t=1768076344\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/e7269bb149d850ff080b9391a7871df5.webm?t=1768076344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/bc5ccfa944497c99b107926715861d28.avif?t=1768076344\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Work in a team to reach the destination safely. An honourable <strong>IDS ASSET</strong> will<strong> always</strong>\u00a0sacrifice their colleagues to increase company profits. Do not hesitate to turn your friends into fuel for your safe travels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/24760e02aa8f44fffea24a72b118319f.poster.avif?t=1768076344\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/24760e02aa8f44fffea24a72b118319f.webm?t=1768076344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/f416e4fd113fa4ba5bd8cf8d64cacbab.avif?t=1768076344\" width=1560 height=422 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As an\u00a0<strong>IDS ASSET</strong>\u00a0your journey may be difficult. The company has provided the following recommendations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/e5e9053431e148309d41c8d310146c08.avif?t=1768076344\" width=348 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/515ee738f482b030c19241f027de6dd0.avif?t=1768076344\" width=348 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/43f980cab38cbc566974bcfc6f5a0f14.poster.avif?t=1768076344\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/43f980cab38cbc566974bcfc6f5a0f14.webm?t=1768076344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/f6164cb1f7835184e39d3cb8ccb26b88.avif?t=1768076344\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deliver packages for the <strong>Intergalactic Delivery Service</strong> aboard the <strong>Company Train</strong>! Keep your equipment running, and be careful of what lurks in the vents...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/cb8a4e68aaf835a3581be9a4973f8137.poster.avif?t=1768076344\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/cb8a4e68aaf835a3581be9a4973f8137.webm?t=1768076344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/5ce8b6d11e8963d624af5faf4e6ab91b.avif?t=1768076344\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The company has provided the <strong>CCTV System</strong>. Utilize this effectively to scout for evil do-ers, while managing your power across the entire train. Once the power runs out, the CCTV system will become unresponsive, and all doors will automatically open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/fa64d577e144db8401f974266d8d656b.poster.avif?t=1768076344\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/fa64d577e144db8401f974266d8d656b.webm?t=1768076344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/669818eba6ad73c0d9cccf88bbaad4df.avif?t=1768076344\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A little too dark? All employees come equipped with standard equipment. This includes the Personal Battery, which can be charged by draining the trains power. The Employee Flashlight, which can be upgraded with credits. And finally the employees Multi Tool. This tool can be used for long range communication, and for fighting back against the Package Thieves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/a8d2b429eba21de52f223fc0ab3dbcf0.poster.avif?t=1768076344\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/a8d2b429eba21de52f223fc0ab3dbcf0.webm?t=1768076344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/3965198546f0dc5e891b7d061b8f9a70.